{
  "slug": "build-loud",
  "name": "Build Loud",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Auto-capture your coding sessions into a build-in-public journal. Scores entries, writes in your voice. Zero dependencies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `j` (Shortcut for /journal), `journal` (Log a build-in-public journal entry — wins, blockers, insights, milestones), `journal-digest` (Generate a weekly narrative summary of your building activity), `journal-publish` (Rewrite journal entries in your voice for Twitter, LinkedIn, or blog), `journal-review` (Browse, curate, and clean up captured journal entries by score), `journey-init` (Set up your voice, notification preferences, and target platforms for build-in-public journaling)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install build-loud@claude-community` from `marylin/buildloud`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
